title: "Nuclear-grade Context Engineering"
abstract: "An open, Git-native reference workflow for exposing evidence custody and actor-evidence coupling in AI-assisted software acceptance. It synthesizes public ideas from professional self-review, consequence-graded oversight, configuration management, provenance, software assurance, and secure development. The repository does not claim demonstrated efficacy, compliance, certification, or conceptual priority for the established controls it adapts."
